WEBVTT

00:00.600 --> 00:10.740
Tsuki no kaasu tsumetai yume no naka de

00:00.600 --> 00:10.740
Under the moon’s curse, inside of a cold dream…

00:19.240 --> 00:25.630
Kotoba no nai sekai de bokura wa ai wo kataru

00:19.240 --> 00:25.630
In a world without words, we speak of love

00:25.630 --> 00:29.590
itsuka kimi ni todoku made

00:25.630 --> 00:29.590
until it reaches you someday.

00:32.420 --> 00:39.310
Kizu darake no kaina de dakiyoseta kuchibiru no

00:32.420 --> 00:39.310
I want to melt the frozen over wish...

00:39.310 --> 00:44.980
haritsumeta negai tokashitakute

00:39.310 --> 00:44.980
from the lips that I embraced with arms covered in wounds.

00:45.230 --> 00:51.940
Nee, aishiatta kako no utsukushisa sutesareba

00:45.230 --> 00:51.940
Hey, if I abandon the beauty of the past when we loved each other,

00:52.320 --> 00:58.120
ashita motto kirei na yoru e yukeru kara

00:52.320 --> 00:58.120
then tomorrow, I can go to a more beautiful night.

00:58.490 --> 01:06.670
Tsuki no kaasu tsumetai yume no naka kara

00:58.490 --> 01:06.670
Under the moon’s curse, from inside of a cold dream.

01:06.670 --> 01:13.340
Kimi wo tooku tsuresaritakute

01:06.670 --> 01:13.340
I want to take you somewhere far away,

01:13.340 --> 01:16.760
doko made yukeru

01:13.340 --> 01:16.760
and go anywhere,

01:16.760 --> 01:24.350
ai wo shinjite ii basho made

01:16.760 --> 01:24.350
to a place where we can believe in love.

01:34.910 --> 01:37.620
Soubi himself... not even able to move...

01:37.620 --> 01:39.550
Who did he fight with, anyway?

01:40.410 --> 01:45.200
I could tell by the sound of his voice, he was
beaten pretty badly...

01:45.200 --> 01:46.750
Huh? It's busy...

01:46.750 --> 01:49.120
What? He's the one who called us.

01:49.120 --> 01:50.770
Who's he talking to?

01:53.910 --> 01:55.090
Oh, that's it!

01:55.600 --> 01:57.040
Over where that steel tower is!

02:09.230 --> 02:11.400
Soubi, are you alive?

02:26.630 --> 02:27.460
Who are you?

02:31.880 --> 02:33.720
Are you sure?

02:33.720 --> 02:36.420
Please don't stain the seats...

02:36.420 --> 02:38.190
Whatever, just drive.

02:43.270 --> 02:45.020
Oh, I see...

02:45.020 --> 02:48.470
So this is the Loveless everyone's talking about,
Ritsuka Aoyagi.

02:48.470 --> 02:50.230
Ritsuka, are you in the 6th grade?

02:51.900 --> 02:53.400
What are you mad about?

02:53.760 --> 02:55.400
Hey, you in the 6th grade or what?

02:55.940 --> 02:57.110
Don't touch me!

02:58.910 --> 03:01.110
Why are you so jumpy?

03:01.490 --> 03:03.250
So cute...

03:03.910 --> 03:05.830
Don't mess with Ritsuka.

03:05.830 --> 03:06.770
Soubi!

03:10.880 --> 03:13.380
Oh, Soubi, you're still alive?

03:13.380 --> 03:17.050
Hey you, why did you call
us when you have Ritsuka?

03:17.440 --> 03:19.650
I wasn't expecting Ritsuka...

03:20.430 --> 03:25.880
I really wanted to reach Kio, but, I
didn't have a choice so I called you guys.

03:25.880 --> 03:29.270
Oh, fine! Sorry we weren't Kio!

03:31.610 --> 03:32.610
Kio?

03:33.360 --> 03:34.430
And besides...

03:35.700 --> 03:39.330
Natsuo and Youji, who are they?

03:39.330 --> 03:40.290
Stop...

03:41.330 --> 03:43.700
Ritsuka, you should get going.

03:43.910 --> 03:44.790
What?

03:45.170 --> 03:46.560
Don't you have a curfew?

03:47.330 --> 03:48.690
Don't worry about me.

03:48.690 --> 03:50.880
I will worry! I'm going, too!

03:50.880 --> 03:52.000
I can't go home like this!

04:25.870 --> 04:28.760
Well done, Sakagami Kouya!

04:28.760 --> 04:32.310
We tore this off of
Agatsuma Soubi's ear.

04:35.760 --> 04:36.830
Oh, wonderful!

04:38.510 --> 04:39.420
But wait...

04:39.420 --> 04:42.300
Yamato Nakano, you're injured!

04:42.620 --> 04:45.470
Don't tell me you've
been bitten by Soubi?

04:45.640 --> 04:48.020
Oh, sorry, I'm fine.

04:48.020 --> 04:51.060
You're the test type of the Zero Series...

04:51.400 --> 04:53.870
...so there are still a few
bugs in your genetic structure.

04:54.570 --> 05:00.020
If you become a burden to Kouya,
I'll switch you for an upgraded Sacrifice.

05:00.450 --> 05:03.440
Professor Nagisa! I only want Yamato!

05:03.440 --> 05:04.990
I am Yamato's Sentouki!

05:05.410 --> 05:09.830
Come on, Kouya, that
sentiment is only for the natural ones.

05:09.830 --> 05:12.710
For a man-made Zero Series like you...

05:12.710 --> 05:14.410
...we can replace partners
whenever we want.

05:15.550 --> 05:17.410
Replace...

05:17.410 --> 05:18.480
But...

05:18.480 --> 05:20.290
Don't worry.

05:20.710 --> 05:24.470
I rather die than
be a hindrance to Kouya.

05:24.860 --> 05:25.800
Yamato!

05:26.090 --> 05:28.260
I'm glad you understand.

05:30.560 --> 05:33.270
Well, Kouya. Go home
and relax tonight.

05:33.540 --> 05:34.640
Okay!

05:35.190 --> 05:36.730
Excuse us!

05:36.970 --> 05:38.690
Good night!

05:49.480 --> 05:50.590
Yamato.

05:50.590 --> 05:53.620
I'm hungry. Shall
we grab a bite to eat?

05:53.620 --> 05:55.460
Come on, Yamato, listen to me!

05:55.460 --> 05:56.410
Hmm?

05:56.410 --> 05:57.870
Why did you say that?

05:58.290 --> 06:01.350
Cause, Professor Nagisa's right.

06:01.350 --> 06:04.590
If I'm a burden, it's better that I die.

06:04.590 --> 06:05.570
No!

06:05.570 --> 06:07.120
It's not that, but...

06:07.120 --> 06:08.880
We're always together!

06:09.270 --> 06:12.910
You're gonna say "If Yamato
dies, I'll die", right?

06:13.300 --> 06:15.200
That's getting a little old.

06:17.150 --> 06:19.810
Whatever, you don't need to die!

06:19.810 --> 06:21.150
Let's go for donuts!

06:23.910 --> 06:24.980
Yamato!

06:29.660 --> 06:33.580
If you want to change
the subject, kiss me!

06:37.750 --> 06:39.710
How did it end up this way?

06:40.880 --> 06:42.290
Well, it's fine with me.

07:00.980 --> 07:01.770
You're bright red.

07:06.860 --> 07:09.120
If you love me that much...

07:09.910 --> 07:11.160
...buy me some donuts.

07:12.750 --> 07:14.900
It's not my fault if you get fat.

07:28.010 --> 07:30.180
How about the hospital?

07:30.180 --> 07:31.470
Nah.

07:32.140 --> 07:33.140
You wouldn't know what to do if...

07:33.140 --> 07:34.510
...a doctor started
asking questions.

07:35.140 --> 07:36.230
But...

07:36.890 --> 07:38.550
He's sleeping well.

07:38.550 --> 07:39.430
Yeah...

07:40.340 --> 07:41.870
He'll be fine.

07:42.280 --> 07:43.190
Yeah...

07:44.190 --> 07:47.110
He can recover from
that damage by sleeping.

07:47.740 --> 07:49.510
He'll regain his strength in one night.

07:52.700 --> 07:56.990
See, the scar from me driving a
nail through his hand is almost gone.

07:56.990 --> 07:58.610
You did that?

07:58.610 --> 08:00.830
Ritsuka, want some juice?

08:00.830 --> 08:04.420
What's this? Natsuo,
you're awfully nice.

08:04.760 --> 08:06.710
You're pleased with Ritsuka?

08:07.930 --> 08:09.510
Well, he's cute.

08:11.560 --> 08:12.740
Cold?

08:12.740 --> 08:14.760
We don't know how that feels.

08:15.560 --> 08:17.590
It's fine that he's cute...

08:17.590 --> 08:21.230
...but letting his
Sentouki get this worn out...

08:21.410 --> 08:23.430
Yeah, I don't like that.

08:23.430 --> 08:24.600
So, it's my fault now!

08:24.890 --> 08:26.970
Of course it is.

08:26.970 --> 08:30.940
Soubi always gets hurt because
you make him battle alone...

08:31.740 --> 08:34.400
Sacrifices never do that!

08:34.740 --> 08:37.370
That's because Soubi doesn't call me!

08:37.370 --> 08:39.580
He fights solo on his own!

08:39.820 --> 08:41.350
What are you saying?

08:41.710 --> 08:45.710
When a Sentouki initiates
the System, the Sacrifice knows!

08:46.340 --> 08:48.450
That's what it means to be connected!

08:51.090 --> 08:52.370
That's embarrassing...

08:52.850 --> 08:55.250
You guys are a pair, but you're not connected.

08:56.270 --> 08:59.830
You and Soubi aren't
just two individuals, you know!

09:01.190 --> 09:03.190
Don't pick on him too much.

09:03.190 --> 09:05.690
The two weren't paired
to begin with, right?

09:05.690 --> 09:06.470
What?

09:08.780 --> 09:09.900
Did you know?

09:09.900 --> 09:13.650
Soubi used to be so strong back then...

09:13.650 --> 09:16.540
...when Seimei Aoyagi was with him.

09:16.540 --> 09:17.710
Seimei?

09:17.710 --> 09:20.350
Yeah. It's a famous story...

09:20.350 --> 09:23.620
Seimei and Soubi, the mightiest legend.

09:23.620 --> 09:26.750
Do you know
something about Seimei?

09:26.750 --> 09:29.210
Why was Seimei killed?

09:29.210 --> 09:30.230
We don't know.

09:31.340 --> 09:34.070
We were at Professor Nagisa's.

09:34.640 --> 09:35.800
Professor Nagisa?

09:36.190 --> 09:40.630
Professor Nagisa researches
and develops Sentouki...

09:41.100 --> 09:43.410
She made us.

09:44.470 --> 09:45.670
Made?

09:46.230 --> 09:49.010
You really don't know anything, do you?

09:54.320 --> 09:59.810
Seimei, I don't know
anything, I can't do anything...

10:00.250 --> 10:01.620
What should I do?

10:04.000 --> 10:05.110
Please...

10:06.420 --> 10:08.320
Please tell me...

10:10.090 --> 10:11.410
Not knowing...

10:12.820 --> 10:14.800
...anything at all...

10:15.260 --> 10:16.980
I can't take it anymore!

10:29.190 --> 10:30.640
Oh! Come on!

10:34.490 --> 10:36.930
There you are, careless king!

10:36.930 --> 10:38.320
Weird outfit.

10:38.320 --> 10:39.680
You look like a princess.

10:40.450 --> 10:43.330
I'm not sure how to react to being
complimented by you.

10:44.120 --> 10:46.130
I'm telling you it's nauseating.

10:47.080 --> 10:50.580
In any case, did you see my
e-mail with that image attached to it?

10:51.050 --> 10:54.870
I noticed you were the
sender, so I deleted it.

10:54.870 --> 10:56.130
Read my e-mails!

10:57.340 --> 10:58.630
Fine.

10:58.630 --> 11:01.970
I figured it as much,
so I printed the image.

11:01.970 --> 11:02.630
Here!

11:03.480 --> 11:04.420
This is?

11:05.170 --> 11:06.470
Doesn't it look familiar?

11:06.470 --> 11:07.180
Not at all.

11:07.470 --> 11:09.770
It was torn off from your pupil!

11:10.040 --> 11:10.990
What?

11:10.990 --> 11:14.470
In other words, Soubi was defeated!

11:14.470 --> 11:19.210
My cute Zero beat him up so
bad, so there you have it!

11:19.210 --> 11:20.330
Soubi?

11:20.330 --> 11:22.490
That's what I've been telling you!

11:22.490 --> 11:24.120
That earring is your proof!

11:24.120 --> 11:25.500
Soubi has pierced ears?

11:25.500 --> 11:26.910
Yes!

11:26.910 --> 11:30.830
Acknowledge it, your
Soubi lost to my Zero!

11:31.500 --> 11:32.890
Not possible.

11:32.890 --> 11:34.090
Well?

11:34.090 --> 11:36.250
You're not going to admit your defeat?

11:36.670 --> 11:38.210
I'm sure you cheated.

11:39.140 --> 11:41.310
Cheating? What do you mean cheating?

11:41.310 --> 11:43.600
Be quiet, I'm working...

11:54.440 --> 11:56.360
It wasn't cheating!

11:56.750 --> 12:00.190
You probably forced him
to fight two against one.

12:01.370 --> 12:02.200
Did I hit the mark?

12:02.870 --> 12:07.040
Unless his Sacrifice
commands him, he won't fight.

12:08.000 --> 12:10.160
He's really a sweet kid.

12:10.160 --> 12:12.030
He's not sweet!

12:12.420 --> 12:15.170
Ritsu, you favor him too much, you fool!

12:15.460 --> 12:21.970
Favoring him or not, your
Zeros will never win over Soubi.

12:21.970 --> 12:22.880
Yes, we can!

12:23.470 --> 12:25.090
Zero or not, you can't win.

12:25.090 --> 12:26.720
I'm telling you we can!

12:28.820 --> 12:32.770
In any case. If you're going
to fight, please mind the rules.

12:36.990 --> 12:37.860
Fine!

12:38.490 --> 12:41.330
If you say so, let's do two against two!

12:42.580 --> 12:44.780
I'm looking forward to seeing your teary face!

12:45.100 --> 12:46.670
Not interested...

12:47.370 --> 12:48.700
Besides, I don't cry.

12:49.020 --> 12:50.880
I will make you!

12:53.090 --> 12:55.150
I will definitely make you cry!

12:59.930 --> 13:04.080
Basically, a Sentouki acts in accordance
to the Sacrifice's intentions...

13:04.510 --> 13:08.680
It's especially true for Soubi. He wants to give
everything for his Sacrifice.

13:08.680 --> 13:10.950
An ideal Sentouki...

13:10.950 --> 13:14.610
But I don't like it.
He's powerful, but has no will.

13:14.610 --> 13:17.610
It's ideal not to
have any will? Why?

13:17.610 --> 13:18.520
Why?

13:18.520 --> 13:20.680
The reason doesn't matter!

13:20.680 --> 13:22.590
That's why you're no good!

13:23.530 --> 13:25.860
It's not worth thinking about this...

13:25.860 --> 13:29.150
When the master hesitates, it's
the dog that gets whipped around...

13:29.540 --> 13:31.620
...you just need to give out orders!

13:32.000 --> 13:34.390
That's what he wants.

13:34.390 --> 13:37.370
I'm not his master.

13:38.130 --> 13:41.840
I'm sure Seimei treated
Soubi like a dog.

13:42.930 --> 13:44.870
If you can't do that...

13:46.890 --> 13:49.700
...you can't be Soubi's Sacrifice.

13:52.900 --> 13:53.760
No...

13:56.480 --> 13:59.230
I don't want that!

14:13.810 --> 14:14.370
Yes?

14:14.370 --> 14:15.880
Hello, Kouya?

14:15.880 --> 14:19.010
Listen, it has to be
two against two after all.

14:19.010 --> 14:22.420
Go beat up Ritsuka
Aoyagi along with Soubi!

14:22.850 --> 14:24.980
You're telling us to go again, right?

14:24.980 --> 14:26.560
Wait, who is this?

14:26.560 --> 14:27.630
Yamato?

14:27.970 --> 14:28.840
Where's Kouya?

14:28.840 --> 14:30.880
Kouya is puking right now.

14:30.880 --> 14:31.600
Huh?

14:35.810 --> 14:37.390
What should I do?

14:37.390 --> 14:39.440
I can't stop getting nauseous.

14:39.760 --> 14:40.950
What's wrong?

14:41.360 --> 14:42.740
Is Kouya okay?

14:42.740 --> 14:44.950
Maybe she's pregnant.

14:45.660 --> 14:48.400
No!

14:48.640 --> 14:49.990
What are you talking about?

14:49.990 --> 14:51.320
Who's child is it?

14:51.640 --> 14:52.700
Mine.

14:52.700 --> 14:55.420
Hey, Yamato, are you crazy?

14:55.420 --> 14:57.510
I'll kill you if you
do something to Kouya...

15:00.420 --> 15:03.860
I wish she was pregnant...

15:06.720 --> 15:09.390
So you can have a baby just by kissing...

15:09.390 --> 15:10.680
Sure you can.

15:13.980 --> 15:16.140
What are you afraid of,
what's making you nauseous?

15:20.150 --> 15:21.400
Losing...

15:23.320 --> 15:24.870
...you.

15:29.030 --> 15:32.200
I'll replace you with a new Sacrifice.

15:32.490 --> 15:33.550
I'm scared...

15:34.120 --> 15:36.870
Professor Nagisa doesn't hesitate
to say things like that...

15:37.710 --> 15:39.160
Is she serious?

15:40.080 --> 15:41.120
I can't take it.

15:41.990 --> 15:44.500
To replace a Sacrifice...

15:45.170 --> 15:47.340
To separate from Yamato...

15:55.100 --> 15:55.830
Kouya.

16:06.610 --> 16:07.570
Strongly...

16:11.780 --> 16:13.280
Just by thinking of you strongly...

16:15.140 --> 16:21.540
I wish you could
become mine, all of you!

16:25.800 --> 16:27.630
You should become mine!

16:31.300 --> 16:34.720
Sacrifice and Sentouki
will always find each other.

16:34.720 --> 16:37.860
I always thought it was strange...

16:37.860 --> 16:40.310
...but where is Loveless' Sentouki?

16:40.600 --> 16:41.310
What?

16:41.310 --> 16:43.430
Come to think of it, you're right.

16:43.430 --> 16:45.940
Isn't Soubi my Sentouki?

16:45.940 --> 16:49.460
Soubi is Seimei's... Beloved's Sentouki.

16:49.460 --> 16:52.920
Right, he's definitely not this guy's.

16:52.920 --> 16:57.070
There's got to be a Sentouki with
the name "Loveless" somewhere.

16:57.500 --> 17:00.450
What are you gonna do
when the real one appears?

17:00.860 --> 17:02.170
What do you mean what am I gonna do?

17:02.170 --> 17:04.560
Of course, it'll be "sayonara" to Soubi.

17:04.560 --> 17:07.690
The bond of a pair with the same
name is much stronger.

17:08.010 --> 17:08.460
That...

17:08.750 --> 17:09.840
I see!

17:09.840 --> 17:12.590
You'll just have to ditch Soubi then.

17:12.590 --> 17:14.550
Poor Soubi!

17:14.550 --> 17:16.970
That doesn't mean anything!

17:17.390 --> 17:18.660
It doesn't mean anything...

17:20.690 --> 17:21.660
Soubi!

17:25.360 --> 17:27.520
What's this?

17:29.320 --> 17:30.320
You can hear it?

17:30.320 --> 17:32.180
Ritsuka, you've made progress...

17:32.530 --> 17:34.220
You're starting to get it.

17:35.620 --> 17:38.400
Somebody's Sentouki is initiating the System.

17:39.540 --> 17:40.910
Let's go check it out.

17:40.910 --> 17:43.440
It must be the ones who did this to Soubi.

17:43.440 --> 17:44.710
It could be fun.

17:44.710 --> 17:46.960
Wait, isn't it dangerous?

17:46.960 --> 17:48.550
Leave it to us.

17:48.550 --> 17:51.920
Ritsuka, you can just
baby-sit Soubi here.

17:52.470 --> 17:53.940
But...

17:55.550 --> 17:56.220
Ritsuka.

17:58.350 --> 17:59.590
Soubi!

18:06.850 --> 18:09.650
Whoa! Look, two old ladies!

18:10.210 --> 18:12.160
That's mean.

18:12.160 --> 18:13.860
They're pretty cute.

18:14.180 --> 18:16.700
I heard a bad word.

18:16.910 --> 18:19.660
We are Zero, you?

18:23.170 --> 18:24.670
No way, don't talk nonsense!

18:24.670 --> 18:26.460
We're Zero.

18:26.460 --> 18:28.620
Old ladies like you can't be Zero!

18:35.510 --> 18:36.560
Could it be...

18:37.970 --> 18:41.560
Professor Nagisa really did...

18:41.560 --> 18:44.010
...make Zeros other than us...

18:44.600 --> 18:46.520
New replacements!

18:47.030 --> 18:47.890
...Ritsuka?

18:47.890 --> 18:48.940
Get a hold of yourself!

18:49.350 --> 18:51.300
Right now, there are enemies outside!

18:51.940 --> 18:53.390
What are you doing?

18:53.950 --> 18:55.530
Ritsuka, I love you.

18:55.530 --> 18:58.630
T-This is not the time!
Natsuo and Youji are...

18:59.360 --> 19:01.740
I don't care about other people...

19:06.960 --> 19:09.160
There were other zeros...

19:09.160 --> 19:11.110
We didn't know.

19:11.110 --> 19:13.670
I don't think we need to have
these old ones, don't you think?

19:15.220 --> 19:16.260
I don't need it...

19:17.010 --> 19:20.180
I don't need any replacements...

19:21.430 --> 19:22.890
We don't need you guys!

19:24.100 --> 19:25.560
Kouya, let's not.

19:25.560 --> 19:27.560
Our enemy isn't them, but...

19:27.560 --> 19:28.630
No, I'm going to defeat them!

19:29.020 --> 19:32.060
I'll make it clear which one of us needed, right here, right now!

19:34.820 --> 19:35.870
Not good...

19:35.870 --> 19:39.470
A battle between two zeros, I won't last.

19:40.700 --> 19:43.570
Well, let's try that spell.

19:46.290 --> 19:49.310
I didn't think we'd
ever have to use it, but...

19:49.880 --> 19:53.830
...a battle between zeros with
no sense of pain is a waste of time.

19:54.200 --> 19:55.710
But that...

19:55.710 --> 19:58.000
What are you blabbering about?

19:58.000 --> 20:00.510
Whatever it is... just try it, old ladies!

20:00.800 --> 20:03.390
Are you okay with making them fight?

20:05.560 --> 20:07.430
This skin is in the way.

20:12.690 --> 20:15.650
This skin that divides you and me...

20:14.060 --> 20:15.650
is in the way.

20:22.490 --> 20:24.320
Youji!!!

20:27.280 --> 20:29.800
What did you do to Youji?

20:29.800 --> 20:32.940
As Zero, there is a spell
that you don't know about!

20:33.300 --> 20:34.960
Why are you crying?

20:34.960 --> 20:36.250
I don't get it!

20:37.670 --> 20:39.350
Total restraint.

20:40.430 --> 20:41.720
The battle is over.

20:41.720 --> 20:43.830
Natsuo! Youji!

20:45.560 --> 20:47.200
Youji!

20:53.360 --> 20:55.030
So you're Loveless.

20:55.030 --> 20:58.210
Tomorrow, late afternoon,
we fight two against two.

20:59.700 --> 21:00.820
Your reply?

21:04.530 --> 21:05.370
Fine!

21:05.370 --> 21:06.570
Ritsuka, don't!

21:06.570 --> 21:08.530
As soon as the fight started,
he immediately collapsed!

21:08.790 --> 21:10.640
I don't know what happened!

21:10.640 --> 21:13.500
Those guys... those guys are crazy!

21:14.280 --> 21:15.500
You're sure?

21:16.090 --> 21:16.960
Yes!

21:18.010 --> 21:18.920
And you?

21:22.890 --> 21:23.840
Of course.

21:24.680 --> 21:26.710
I just follow Ritsuka's decisions...

21:27.560 --> 21:30.290
...because I'm Ritsuka's Sentouki.

21:29.850 --> 21:34.770
To be continued...

21:31.010 --> 21:40.570
Setsunasa no kagiri made dakishimete mo

21:31.010 --> 21:40.570
Even if I hold you with all my suffering,

21:41.440 --> 21:50.950
itsu made mo hitotsu ni wa narenakute

21:41.440 --> 21:50.950
we still can't be one.

21:51.540 --> 22:01.460
Yasashisa yori fukai basho de fureau no wa itami dake

21:51.540 --> 22:01.460
The only thing that we can feel deep within besides kindness is pain,

22:01.880 --> 22:09.470
futari wo musunde kudasai

22:01.880 --> 22:09.470
so please, bind the two of us together.

22:12.010 --> 22:16.850
Bokura wa mou yume wo minai

22:12.010 --> 22:16.850
We no longer dream anymore,

22:16.850 --> 22:21.980
tomadoinagara te wo totte

22:16.850 --> 22:21.980
when you're wavering, take my hand

22:22.270 --> 22:31.200
zankoku na yoake no hou e arukidasu

22:22.270 --> 22:31.200
as we tread towards the cruel light of dawn.

22:32.330 --> 22:42.340
Hontou no kotoba wa kitto hontou no sekai no dokoka

22:32.330 --> 22:42.340
I'm sure real words are somewhere in the real world.

22:42.670 --> 22:51.550
Bokura no mukuchi na yoru ni hisonderu

22:42.670 --> 22:51.550
They lurk in the shadows of our silent nights.

22:51.930 --> 22:57.060
Ima mo kitto

22:51.930 --> 22:57.060
Surely, even now...

23:00.940 --> 23:03.360
Soubi, it's been a while.

23:03.360 --> 23:06.310
Replacing Sacrifices, what is that?

23:06.310 --> 23:07.840
I can still see it.

23:08.200 --> 23:10.790
Your ears, your tail...

23:10.790 --> 23:13.970
Why are those two cutting off bonds?

23:13.970 --> 23:15.620
That's not the problem.

23:15.960 --> 23:17.760
Only one thing interests me...

23:18.580 --> 23:20.710
Tale ten, Nameless.

23:21.590 --> 23:24.660
Soubi, you're still mine, even now.
